  "description": "A rope-triangle model for marking a right angle. Source facts: three closed edges, three/two/four internal single ticks on the upper-left/right/base edges, and an upper-right right-angle box; no labels or units. Modern text-derived regularization: ideal straight sides with exact length ratio 4:3:5, equal common subdivisions and perpendicular legs. These coordinates are not source-pixel measurements; 104 is only an internal drawing scale, not a given physical unit. Small vertex footprints lie entirely within the edge strokes, without added point markers or names.",
